3.2 Configuration Testing Results
Multiple configurations were tested to optimize power transfer:

Best configuration: Parallel resonant TX with large coil, high drive only, small coil RX → 3.592V into 470Ω

Current configuration: Large+Large coil (for robustness) → 3.178V into 470Ω

1kΩ load achieved full 4.9V output

Optimal duty cycle: 25% (balances charge current vs. coil self-heating)

